<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Lisnave hits record low.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Lisnave hits record low.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in loss-making ship repairer Lisnave hit an all-time low of 250 escudos, down 41 percent from Friday, on Lisbon bourse, dealers said.</p>
</text>
